pan class="section-kicker">Operational support for companies</span> <h1>Source in China. Bring structure to sales.</h1> <div class="button-row"> <a class="button button-gold" href="/en/contact">Free initial call</a> <a class="button button-ghost" href="/en/services">All services</a> </div> <p class="service-hero-intro">Looking to source products in China or structure sales in Germany? IBS-Saxony supports projects with requirements, native Chinese-language communication, offer comparisons and repeatable sales workflows. Scope and responsibilities are agreed for each engagement.</p> </div> <figure class="china-service-hero-figure"> <picture class="hero-media china-service-hero-media"> <source srcset="/assets/hero-china-einkauf-vertriebsorganisation-v1.webp" type="image/webp"> <img src="/assets/hero-china-einkauf-vertriebsorganisation-v1.png" width="1536" height="1024" alt="Illustrative image: product samples and offer documents at a sourcing desk with port logistics in the background" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"> </picture> <figcaption>Illustrative image: product samples, offer coordination and logistics.</figcaption> </figure> </div> </section> <section class="section section-soft"> <div class="container"> <div class="section-heading"><span class="section-kicker">Sourcing</span><h2>Sourcing: from requirements to a sound comparison</h2><p>A useful decision starts with the same specification for every product and supplier enquiry. We document responses and open questions so offers can be compared.</p></div> <div class="card-grid four"><article class="service-card"><span class="card-index">01</span><h3>Define requirements</h3><p>We organize product, variants, quantity, quality criteria, delivery window and required evidence in a written specification.</p></article><article class="service-card"><span class="card-index">02</span><h3>Research and coordinate suppliers</h3><p>We research suitable suppliers for the case and clarify specifications, minimum orders, variants and availability through native Chinese-language communication.</p></article><article class="service-card"><span class="card-index">03</span><h3>Compare offers and total costs</h3><p>We compare like specifications and separate goods, samples, freight, duties, inspections, payment and delivery terms. Unclear costs remain visible.</p></article><article class="service-card"><span class="card-index">04</span><h3>Coordinate samples and orders</h3><p>When agreed, we help coordinate sample questions, deviations and order documents. The client decides on samples and orders.</p></article></div> </div> </section> <section class="section"> <div class="container"> <div class="section-heading"><span class="section-kicker">Sales</span><h2>Sales: from target customer to traceable order</h2><p>We focus sales operations on suitable customers and dealers in Germany. Product information, terms and responsibilities provide the basis for each step.</p></div> <div class="card-grid three"><article class="service-card"><span class="card-index">01</span><h3>Target customers and dealers</h3><p>We define suitable customer groups, selection criteria and permitted contact routes before outreach or offers are prepared.</p></article><article class="service-card"><span class="card-index">02</span><h3>Offer to complaint</h3><p>We organize product and variant data, terms, offers, follow-up, orders, delivery and complaints into a clear workflow.</p></article><article class="service-card"><span class="card-index">03</span><h3>CRM and indicators</h3><p>A lean CRM structure records only necessary case data. A few indicators distinguish conversations, offers, paid orders, fulfilled deliveries and repeat orders.</p></article></div> </div> </section> <section class="section section-soft"><div class="container narrow service-card related-card"><span class="section-kicker">Deliverables</span><h2>Possible work products</h2><p>Depending on the engagement, you may receive a written requirements brief, documented supplier research, an offer comparison with open checks, a sample record or a sales workflow with responsibilities and templates. We agree which elements make sense for your case.</p></div></section> <section class="section"> <div class="container"> <div class="section-heading"><span class="section-kicker">Approach</span><h2>How a limited project starts</h2><p>The starting point is your specific product or sales bottleneck. Before further work, we agree on the deliverable, client input and cost range.</p></div> <div class="step-grid"><article class="step-card"><span>01</span><h3>Define the task</h3><p>We record the target product or sales problem, market, desired result and responsibilities.</p></article><article class="step-card"><span>02</span><h3>Agree the scope</h3><p>Research routes, comparison criteria, services, third-party costs and decision points are agreed for the engagement.</p></article><article class="step-card"><span>03</span><h3>Review the result</h3><p>We document responses, outstanding evidence and next steps. You decide on any order or further sales work on that basis.</p></article></div> </div> </section> <section class="section section-dark"><div class="container narrow"><span class="section-kicker">Boundaries</span><h2>Professional responsibilities stay clear</h2><p>IBS-Saxony provides operational research, communication and workflow support. Product compliance, customs, tax, legal matters, laboratory tests and qualified audits may require separate evidence or appropriate specialists. A researched supplier is not yet a verified manufacturer; sales and savings are not guaranteed.</p></div></section> <section class="section section-soft"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div class="faq-list"><details class="faq-item"><summary><h3>Which market do you organize sales for?</h3></summary><p>The focus is selling in Germany. Other target markets are agreed only case by case.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary><h3>Do you place the goods order?</h3></summary><p>We can coordinate sample and order documents when agreed. Buyer, importer and payment roles, as well as each specific order, must be clarified in advance.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary><h3>Do you verify manufacturers or product compliance?</h3></summary><p>Research and communication are neither a factory audit nor proof of compliance. Required specialist checks need suitable evidence and, where appropriate, external experts.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary><h3>How does the work begin?</h3></summary><p>In a free initial call, we discuss the product or sales bottleneck, desired result and possible scope. Paid work starts only after a cost range has been agreed.</p></details></div></div></section> <section class="section final-cta"><div class="container"><span class="section-kicker">Next step</span><h2>Start sourcing or sales work with one clear step</h2><p>Describe your product or sales bottleneck in a free initial call. We clarify which operational support and next step fit your case.</p><a class="button button-gold" href="/en/contact">Free initial call</a></div></section>  </main> <footer class="site-footer"> <div class="footer-grid"> <div> <img class="footer-logo" src="/assets/logo-ibs-saxony-white.png" alt="IBS-Saxony"> <p>Process optimization, systems integration and digital tools for companies in Saxony.</p> <details class="footer-legal-note"> <summary><span>Legal notice</span></summary> <p>IBS-Saxony does not provide legal, insolvency, tax, financial or other binding professional advice. Our support is limited to operational workflows, data, organization and implementation; legal, tax, insolvency or financial questions must be reviewed by qualified professionals.</p> </details> </div> <div> <h2>Quick links</h2> <a href="/en/services">Services</a><a href="/en/process-and-documentation-workflows">Workflows</a><a href="/en/references">Work examples</a><a href="/en/about">About</a><a href="/en/contact">Contact</a> </div> <div> <h2>Contact</h2> <a href="mailto:info@ibs-saxony.com">info@ibs-saxony.com</a> <a href="tel:+4915142495353">+49 1514 2495353</a> <p>Ringstraße 12<br>01612 Nünchritz</p> </div> <div> <h2>Legal</h2> <a href="/en/imprint">Imprint</a> <a href="/en/privacy">Privacy</a> <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@ibs-saxony" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">YouTube</a> </div> </div> <div class="footer-bottom"> <span>© 2026 IBS-Saxony UG (haftungsbeschränkt). All rights reserved.</span> <button class="footer-consent" type="button" onclick="window.dispatchEvent(new Event('ibs-saxony-reset-consent'))">Change cookie settings</button> </div> </footer>   <?php if ($ibsHasAnalytics): ?>
